      "body": "项目地址：https://github.com/iot-ecology/rust-iot-platform\r\n\r\n介绍 A high-performance IoT development platform built with Rust, designed for multi-protocol support and real-time data processing. This platform supports MQTT, WebSockets (WS), TCP, and CoAP protocols, making it highly flexible for diverse IoT applications.\r\n\r\n能力\r\n1. 分布式高可用的mqtt客户端管理能力\r\n2. 离线数据计算能力，脚本化编程即可完成计算任务提交\r\n3. 数据报警简单配置即可完成\r\n4. 复杂联动报警通过脚本实现\r\n5. 支持多数据库转发存储\r\n6. 支持飞书 钉钉通知",
